{"slug":"s-m-e","ar":"س م ع","total":185,"core":"hearing; listening","forms":[{"ar":"سَمِعَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":78,"gloss":"Heard","word":"samia","ex":{"s":36,"a":25,"p":4,"ar":["إِنِّىٓ","ءَامَنتُ","بِرَبِّكُمْ","فَٱسْمَعُونِ"],"en":"Indeed, I have believed in your Lord, so listen to me"}},{"ar":"سَمِيع","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":47,"gloss":"The All-Hearing","word":"as-samee","ex":{"s":26,"a":220,"p":3,"ar":["إِنَّهُۥ","هُوَ","ٱلسَّمِيعُ","ٱلْعَلِيمُ"],"en":"Indeed, He is the Hearing, the Knowing"}},{"ar":"سَمْع","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":22,"gloss":"hearing","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":212,"p":3,"ar":["إِنَّهُمْ","عَنِ","ٱلسَّمْعِ","لَمَعْزُولُونَ"],"en":"Indeed they, from [its] hearing, are removed"}},{"ar":"ٱسْتَمَعَ","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":16,"gloss":"to listen","word":null,"ex":{"s":20,"a":13,"p":3,"ar":["وَأَنَا","ٱخْتَرْتُكَ","فَٱسْتَمِعْ","لِمَا","يُوحَىٰٓ"],"en":"And I have chosen you, so listen to what is revealed [to you]"}},{"ar":"أَسْمَعَ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":13,"gloss":"to cause to hear","word":null,"ex":{"s":8,"a":23,"p":6,"ar":["وَلَوْ","عَلِمَ","ٱللَّهُ","فِيهِمْ","خَيْرًا","لَّأَسْمَعَهُمْ ۖ","وَلَوْ","أَسْمَعَهُمْ","لَتَوَلَّوا۟","وَّهُم","مُّعْرِضُونَ"],"en":"Had Allah known any good in them, He would have made them hear. And if He had made them hear, they would [still] have turned away, while they were refusing"}},{"ar":"سَمَّٰعُون","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"eager listeners","word":null,"ex":{"s":9,"a":47,"p":13,"ar":["لَوْ","خَرَجُوا۟","فِيكُم","مَّا","زَادُوكُمْ","إِلَّا","خَبَالًا","وَلَأَوْضَعُوا۟","خِلَـٰلَكُمْ","يَبْغُونَكُمُ","ٱلْفِتْنَةَ","وَفِيكُمْ","سَمَّـٰعُونَ","لَهُمْ ۗ","وَٱللَّهُ","عَلِيمٌۢ","بِٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ"],"en":"Had they gone forth with you, they would not have increased you except in confusion, and they would have been active among you, seeking [to cause] you fitnah. And among you are avid listeners to them. And Allah is Knowing of the wrongdoers"}},{"ar":"مُسْتَمِع","kind":"active participle","form":8,"count":2,"gloss":"listener","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":15,"p":7,"ar":["قَالَ","كَلَّا ۖ","فَٱذْهَبَا","بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ ۖ","إِنَّا","مَعَكُم","مُّسْتَمِعُونَ"],"en":"[Allah] said, \"No. Go both of you with Our signs; indeed, We are with you, listening"}},{"ar":"مُسْمَع","kind":"passive participle","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"made to hear","word":null,"ex":{"s":4,"a":46,"p":13,"ar":["مِّنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","هَادُوا۟","يُحَرِّفُونَ","ٱلْكَلِمَ","عَن","مَّوَاضِعِهِۦ","وَيَقُولُونَ","سَمِعْنَا","وَعَصَيْنَا","وَٱسْمَعْ","غَيْرَ","مُسْمَعٍ","وَرَٰعِنَا","لَيًّۢا","بِأَلْسِنَتِهِمْ","وَطَعْنًا","فِى","ٱلدِّينِ ۚ","وَلَوْ","أَنَّهُمْ","قَالُوا۟","سَمِعْنَا","وَأَطَعْنَا","وَٱسْمَعْ","وَٱنظُرْنَا","لَكَانَ","خَيْرًا","لَّهُمْ","وَأَقْوَمَ","وَلَـٰكِن","لَّعَنَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","بِكُفْرِهِمْ","فَلَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ","إِلَّا","قَلِيلًا"],"en":"Among the Jews are those who distort words from their [proper] usages and say, \"We hear and disobey\" and \"Hear but be not heard\" and \"Ra'ina,\" twisting their tongues and defaming the religion. And if they had said [instead], \"We hear and obey\" and \"Wait for us [to understand],\" it would have been better for them and more suitable. But Allah has cursed them for their disbelief, so they believe not, except for a few"}},{"ar":"مُسْمِع","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"one who makes hear","word":null,"ex":{"s":35,"a":22,"p":13,"ar":["وَمَا","يَسْتَوِى","ٱلْأَحْيَآءُ","وَلَا","ٱلْأَمْوَٰتُ ۚ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يُسْمِعُ","مَن","يَشَآءُ ۖ","وَمَآ","أَنتَ","بِمُسْمِعٍ","مَّن","فِى","ٱلْقُبُورِ"],"en":"And not equal are the living and the dead. Indeed, Allah causes to hear whom He wills, but you cannot make hear those in the graves"}},{"ar":"يَسَّمَّعُ","kind":"verb","form":5,"count":1,"gloss":"to listen, eavesdrop","word":null,"ex":{"s":37,"a":8,"p":2,"ar":["لَّا","يَسَّمَّعُونَ","إِلَى","ٱلْمَلَإِ","ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ","وَيُقْذَفُونَ","مِن","كُلِّ","جَانِبٍ"],"en":"[So] they may not listen to the exalted assembly [of angels] and are pelted from every side"}}],"surahs":[[2,16],[8,10],[4,9],[3,7],[5,7],[7,6],[21,6],[26,6],[6,5],[10,5],[24,5],[41,5],[72,5],[9,4],[17,4],[19,4],[22,4],[30,4],[35,4],[46,4],[16,3],[20,3],[27,3],[28,3],[32,3],[45,3],[50,3],[58,3],[67,3],[11,2],[12,2],[18,2],[23,2],[25,2],[29,2],[31,2],[40,2],[43,2],[52,2],[14,1],[15,1],[34,1],[36,1],[37,1],[38,1],[39,1],[42,1],[44,1],[47,1],[49,1],[56,1],[63,1],[64,1],[68,1],[76,1],[78,1],[88,1]]}